WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:05.399
Have extra-terrestrials visited our planet?

00:00:05.399 --> 00:00:11.139
These terrifying real-life abduction stories
seem to suggest that not only have they visited,

00:00:11.139 --> 00:00:13.029
they've been here for a while.

00:00:13.029 --> 00:00:23.370
Watching us, experimenting on us, and even
cross-breeding with humans.

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:29.039
One eerie night in 1976 in rural Maine four
friends who had met at art school went on

00:00:29.039 --> 00:00:30.699
a camping trip.

00:00:30.699 --> 00:00:36.199
On the second night they noticed a very bright
light in the sky and then on the third night,

00:00:36.199 --> 00:00:40.809
undeterred by the looming threat of alien
abduction, they decided to go for a spot of

00:00:40.809 --> 00:00:42.690
night fishing.

00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:47.270
Whilst fishing out on the canoe they noticed
the same bright light again.

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:52.109
One of the men used his flashlight to make
an SOS pattern at the mysterious light.

00:00:52.109 --> 00:00:56.539
This wouldn't prove to be one of his wisest
decisions ever, because shortly afterwards

00:00:56.539 --> 00:01:02.639
the ominous light rapidly expanded and engulfed
all four of them like an alien Pac-Man on

00:01:02.639 --> 00:01:03.639
steroids.

00:01:03.639 --> 00:01:07.689
The next thing the men remembered was waking
up back at their campsite with absolutely

00:01:07.689 --> 00:01:12.079
no idea how they got there and what had happened
in-between.

00:01:12.079 --> 00:01:17.140
The fire they had stoked up before they left
was now completely burned out and all was

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:19.000
left was a pile of ash.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:23.930
If that doesn't scream "we've been abducted
by aliens and inexplicably lost a substantial

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:27.079
period of time" then I don't know what does.

00:01:27.079 --> 00:01:31.619
But no, the four men thought nothing more
of it and finished their camping trip, acting

00:01:31.619 --> 00:01:33.770
like everything was just fine.

00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:37.640
But in the weeks that followed, strange things
started to happen.

00:01:37.640 --> 00:01:42.649
Firstly, all four men started to have the
same horrific nightmares of being aboard a

00:01:42.649 --> 00:01:47.789
spaceship with mysterious beings that had
long necks and large heads.

00:01:47.789 --> 00:01:52.590
In each of the nightmares one of the men was
being humiliatingly experimented on whilst

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:56.810
the other three men helplessly watched, unable
to intervene.

00:01:56.810 --> 00:02:02.909
It was at this point they realised something
serious went down during that camping trip.

00:02:02.909 --> 00:02:09.119
So, disturbed by their dreams, the men later
met with a group of UFO specialists who suggested

00:02:09.119 --> 00:02:14.480
they undergo regressive hypnosis therapy to
make all their horrific memories come flooding

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:15.480
back.

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:20.030
During the sessions all four men revealed
remarkably similar memories of being abducted

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:21.920
and experimented on.

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:28.430
Being artists all four men were able to accurately
sketch their abductors as well as the spacecraft.

00:02:28.430 --> 00:02:31.940
All of the men's sketches were freakishly
similar.

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:36.660
Following psychiatric examinations the men
were all deemed to be mentally stable and

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:39.260
they all passed lie-detector tests.

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:45.450
The unnerving event has since come to be known
as the Allagash Abductions and at the time

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:47.860
it reached national primetime news.

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:53.070
Next up is the horrific story of the abductions
of Jesse Long.

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:59.301
Jesse Long is a man from Tennessee who claims
he was first abducted by aliens in 1957 when

00:02:59.301 --> 00:03:01.940
he was just 5 years old.

00:03:01.940 --> 00:03:05.130
Jesse and his brother were playing on the
hill behind his house.

00:03:05.130 --> 00:03:09.880
When they came upon what appeared to be a
round house under construction, the two boys

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:14.640
obviously hadn't seen enough sci-fi horror
movies because instead of fleeing they stayed

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:17.190
to examine the UFO-like object closer.

00:03:17.190 --> 00:03:22.420
Then, according to Jesse a tall man appeared
next to him and flashed him with a bright

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:23.580
light.

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:27.380
Jesse was instantly paralysed from head to
toe.

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:32.450
Jesse didn't remember anything more about
the event until years later when Jesse underwent

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:34.740
some hypnosis sessions.

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:40.070
During the sessions Jesse remembered himself
and his brother being led down a long hallway

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:41.840
then separated.

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:47.810
Jesse was placed on a flat table and he recalled
an object being implanted into his left shin.

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:55.300
The object remained inside Jesse's leg for
34 years, until, in 1991 he had an operation

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:57.620
to remove it from his leg.

00:03:57.620 --> 00:04:03.700
Alas Jesse's skeptics could deny his convictions
no more, because sure enough there was a strange,

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:06.680
small object inside his left shin.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:09.490
The object appeared to be a shard of glass.

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:13.650
However it was sent for further research at
a laboratory and the research came up with

00:04:13.650 --> 00:04:16.320
some extremely bizarre results.

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:22.019
The South West Research Institute who examined
the supposedly alien object had this to say:

00:04:22.019 --> 00:04:28.720
"The object had a very remarkable composition"
and it "Exhibited unique surface characteristics

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:34.940
that cannot be explained" and that "The questions
outnumbered the answers."

00:04:34.940 --> 00:04:40.750
Jesse claims he has been abducted again multiple
times over the years and in one particular,

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:46.260
apparently extremely traumatic abduction,
Jesse was forced to crossbreed with what he

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:49.320
believed was a female alien being.

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:55.660
In 1990 Jesse Long was driving to New Orleans
right outside of Albuquerque, New Mexico,

00:04:55.660 --> 00:05:00.570
when a light appeared and Jesse's car was
lifted off the interstate, and he was brought

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:05.150
up inside an alien craft, still inside his
car.

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:10.470
Jesse was then placed on a table and presented
with an alien baby and told "this is your

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:11.710
child".

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:16.950
Jesse wasn't sure whether they were simply
informing him of his new alien child or they

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:18.990
were seeking child maintenance.

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:22.740
Either way they seemed rather proud of what
they had accomplished.

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:27.890
This next case is very rare, because it's
one of the few alien abduction cases that

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:33.930
doesn't end in mutilation, death or weird
alien babies, it actually has a happy ending.

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:39.360
John Salter, Jr. was traveling on the highway
with his son, when suddenly they discovered

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:44.560
they were driving in the wrong direction and
they had lost an hour of time, now we all

00:05:44.560 --> 00:05:46.210
what happens next.

00:05:46.210 --> 00:05:50.560
The two men had no memory of what happened
during their lost hour and continued with

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:56.080
their journey as normal, however a little
while later they apparently saw a UFO in the

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:57.139
sky.

00:05:57.139 --> 00:06:02.380
Seeing the mysterious alien craft in the air
jogged John and his son's memories and they

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:06.990
started to remember the strange and disturbing
events that took place during their hour of

00:06:06.990 --> 00:06:08.690
lost time.

00:06:08.690 --> 00:06:15.880
The two men recalled seeing a group of children
and a taller half-human, half alien creature.

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:20.340
However the men both said they were not afraid
of the aliens, they instead felt extremely

00:06:20.340 --> 00:06:24.070
protected and they felt a strong connection
with the alien beings.

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:29.460
The two men were then guided into a room by
their new alien buddies, where they underwent

00:06:29.460 --> 00:06:33.730
a thorough medical examination and peculiar
procedures.

00:06:33.730 --> 00:06:40.050
However, unlike other alien abduction victims
John and his son reported an overall improvement

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:41.050
in their health.

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:46.790
But by far the weirdest part of their story,
and the thing that makes it the most believable

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:52.900
is that John had a scar on his forehead, however
after his abduction the scar had completely

00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:54.830
vanished.

00:06:54.830 --> 00:07:00.600
In most alien abduction cases the abductee
is somewhat, safely returned to Earth and

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:02.910
then they tell other's of their abduction.

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:07.430
But this adds a level of uncertainty into
the validity of their story, because they

00:07:07.430 --> 00:07:10.250
could of course, be making it all up.

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:16.580
That's what makes this next case so believable,
because unlike in most abduction stories,

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:20.280
Frederick Valentich was never, ever seen again.

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:25.800
Twenty-year-old Frederick Valentich was an
aspiring pilot in Australia, until on the

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:33.130
21st October 1978, during a training flight
off the south-east coast of Australia something

00:07:33.130 --> 00:07:35.760
completely unexplainable happened.

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:41.010
During his flight Valentich radioed Melbourne’s
Air Traffic Control to advise them that he

00:07:41.010 --> 00:07:47.320
was being shadowed by an unidentified craft
flying about 1,000 feet above him.

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:52.500
Frederick said the craft was circling his
own and it was emitting an eerie green light.

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:56.830
He then told air traffic control that he was
experiencing engine problems.

00:07:56.830 --> 00:08:02.160
Air traffic control asked him to describe
the other aircraft, to which Frederick replied

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:09.000
"it's not an aircraft" and then suddenly the
transmission was interrupted by metallic,

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:12.420
scraping sounds and all contact was lost.

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:19.300
A four day long search was undertaken of an
area 1,000 square miles large.

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:25.170
But no trace of Frederick Valentich or his
aircraft was ever found.

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:30.360
When the police questioned nearby witnesses
there were numerous reports of people sighting

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:35.930
a UFO in the sky above Australia on the night
of Frederick's disappearance.

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:42.360
And finally is the spookily convincing abduction
of Travis Walton.

00:08:42.360 --> 00:08:49.800
Travis is an American logger who, on the 5th
November 1975, at 22 years old, was working

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:54.660
with a logging crew in the Apache-Sitgreaves
National Forest in Arizona.

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:59.980
When Travis and his crew finished for the
day they were driving home in the same truck,

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:05.660
when all the men spotted a bright yellowish
light from behind a hill up ahead.

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:10.959
They drove closer and they saw a large golden
disc hovering above a clearing.

00:09:10.959 --> 00:09:15.959
The driver stopped the truck and Walton leaped
out and ran towards the disc, the other's

00:09:15.959 --> 00:09:21.079
shouted at Walton to stop and come back to
the truck, but he carried on regardless.

00:09:21.079 --> 00:09:25.779
The rest of the crew insist that they saw
a blue-green light come from the disk and

00:09:25.779 --> 00:09:27.680
strike Walton.

00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:33.060
Walton then rose a foot into the air with
his arms and legs outstretched and then he

00:09:33.060 --> 00:09:36.559
disappeared, along with the hovering gold
disc.

00:09:36.559 --> 00:09:41.459
The other men reported the incident to the
police deputy sheriff when they got home,

00:09:41.459 --> 00:09:46.920
the sheriff reported that all the men were
distraught and two of them were in tears.

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:52.180
A large search party then carried out a search
for Walton over the next few days, but there

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:54.089
was no trace of him.

00:09:54.089 --> 00:10:00.540
Until five days later when Travis Walton mysteriously
reappeared.

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:05.589
Disturbingly Walton had lost a significant
amount of weight during his five days of lost

00:10:05.589 --> 00:10:06.589
time.

00:10:06.589 --> 00:10:11.429
His story reached national news and he has
since wrote a book detailing his apparent

00:10:11.429 --> 00:10:13.370
encounter with a UFO.

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:16.319
Thanks for the view, subscribe for more Thoughty2.

